---

Nature of Release

This is a minimal, self-contained reference implementation.

It is intended to demonstrate a structural intelligence admissibility model — not to represent a full artificial intelligence framework, AGI system, cognition engine, autonomous governance platform, or production AI safety architecture.

Behavioral guarantees apply only within the scope of the reference model and its defined structural assumptions.

